<urn:atm:triage:finding/AJ7-RBQA-F003-NO-MECHANICAL-CHECK>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AJ7-RBQA-F003-NO-MECHANICAL-CHECK" ;
  triage:title "No mechanical check prevents a future guard script from reinventing its own config pattern" ;
  triage:description "There is no mechanical check ensuring new .just/check_*_boundary.py guard scripts follow the shared lint_common.py + .just/lint-config.toml + allowlist pattern established by check_env_var_boundary.py. AJ.7 is the first observed instance of this repeated leak shape. Nothing in run_lint.py, lint_common.py, or the sprint-planning/boundary-guard review docs currently catches this at merge time other than manual QA review. Found by ruthless-boundary-qa. QA source: PR #742, phase-aj-s7-qa-1." ;
